error: the storage quota is full (HTTP 413)

  request:     POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fcli/releases/12/assets
  uploading:   fcli-v1.2.3-linux.tar.gz
  server says: quota exceeded for size:assets

what to do:
  check storage usage, including LFS objects, packages, and release assets.
  1. fcli quota  (what is using the space)
  2. delete old release assets or package versions, or ask an admin to raise
     the quota
  note: check which quota rule applies before removing data.
